1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,461
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,461 --> 00:00:03,699
Let's sing and learn shapes!

3
00:00:04,249 --> 00:00:06,699
Shapes, shapes, shapes!

4
00:00:08,399 --> 00:00:10,674
This is a circle.

5
00:00:11,074 --> 00:00:12,749
Circle, circle,

6
00:00:12,749 --> 00:00:14,424
I see a circle!

7
00:00:14,974 --> 00:00:16,724
A circle is round,

8
00:00:16,724 --> 00:00:17,974
like a ball.

9
00:00:19,674 --> 00:00:21,774
This is a square.

10
00:00:22,174 --> 00:00:23,661
Square, square,

11
00:00:23,661 --> 00:00:25,148
I see a square!

12
00:00:25,698 --> 00:00:27,817
A square has four sides,

13
00:00:27,817 --> 00:00:29,073
all the same.

14
00:00:30,773 --> 00:00:33,223
This is a triangle.

15
00:00:33,623 --> 00:00:35,561
Triangle, triangle,

16
00:00:35,561 --> 00:00:37,322
I see a triangle!

17
00:00:37,872 --> 00:00:40,597
A triangle has three sides.

18
00:00:42,297 --> 00:00:44,397
This is a star.

19
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:46,139
Star, star,

20
00:00:46,139 --> 00:00:47,673
I see a star!

21
00:00:48,223 --> 00:00:50,823
A star twinkles in the sky.

22
00:00:52,523 --> 00:00:55,823
Circle, square, triangle, star.

23
00:00:56,073 --> 00:00:57,494
Shapes are fun,

24
00:00:57,494 --> 00:00:59,072
wherever you are!

25
00:01:02,072 --> 00:01:04,097
This is a heart.

26
00:01:04,497 --> 00:01:05,842
Heart, heart,

27
00:01:05,842 --> 00:01:07,272
I see a heart!

28
00:01:07,822 --> 00:01:10,022
A heart means love.

29
00:01:11,722 --> 00:01:14,097
This is a rectangle.

30
00:01:14,497 --> 00:01:16,603
Rectangle, rectangle,

31
00:01:16,603 --> 00:01:18,447
I see a rectangle!

32
00:01:18,996 --> 00:01:21,796
A rectangle looks like a door.

33
00:01:23,496 --> 00:01:25,746
This is an oval.

34
00:01:26,147 --> 00:01:27,603
Oval, oval,

35
00:01:27,603 --> 00:01:29,371
I see an oval!

36
00:01:29,921 --> 00:01:32,396
An oval looks like an egg.

37
00:01:34,096 --> 00:01:36,296
This is a diamond.

38
00:01:36,696 --> 00:01:38,516
Diamond, diamond,

39
00:01:38,516 --> 00:01:40,245
I see a diamond!

40
00:01:40,795 --> 00:01:43,470
A diamond looks like a kite.

41
00:01:45,170 --> 00:01:47,320
Where is the circle?

42
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,916
There it is!

43
00:01:50,916 --> 00:01:52,219
The circle!

44
00:01:53,919 --> 00:01:55,969
Where is the star?

45
00:01:58,169 --> 00:01:59,627
There it is!

46
00:01:59,627 --> 00:02:00,794
The star!

47
00:02:02,494 --> 00:02:04,494
Where is the heart?

48
00:02:06,694 --> 00:02:08,074
There it is!

49
00:02:08,074 --> 00:02:09,270
The heart!

50
00:02:10,970 --> 00:02:13,818
Now let's play a memory game!

51
00:02:14,368 --> 00:02:15,957
Do you remember?

52
00:02:15,957 --> 00:02:17,043
Let's see!

53
00:02:18,743 --> 00:02:20,818
What shape is this?

54
00:02:23,018 --> 00:02:24,894
A circle!

55
00:02:25,444 --> 00:02:27,744
Yes! Well done!

56
00:02:29,444 --> 00:02:31,519
What shape is this?

57
00:02:33,719 --> 00:02:35,542
A square!

58
00:02:36,092 --> 00:02:38,042
That's right!

59
00:02:39,742 --> 00:02:41,817
What shape is this?

60
00:02:44,017 --> 00:02:46,141
A triangle!

61
00:02:46,691 --> 00:02:48,716
Great job!

62
00:02:50,416 --> 00:02:52,491
What shape is this?

63
00:02:54,691 --> 00:02:56,490
A star!

64
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:59,015
You got it!

65
00:03:00,715 --> 00:03:02,790
What shape is this?

66
00:03:04,990 --> 00:03:06,664
A heart!

67
00:03:07,214 --> 00:03:08,914
Super!

68
00:03:10,614 --> 00:03:12,689
What shape is this?

69
00:03:14,889 --> 00:03:17,013
A rectangle!

70
00:03:17,563 --> 00:03:19,213
Hooray!

71
00:03:20,913 --> 00:03:22,988
What shape is this?

72
00:03:25,188 --> 00:03:27,011
An oval!

73
00:03:27,561 --> 00:03:29,861
Yes! Well done!

74
00:03:31,561 --> 00:03:33,636
What shape is this?

75
00:03:35,836 --> 00:03:37,886
A diamond!

76
00:03:38,436 --> 00:03:40,386
That's right!

77
00:03:42,086 --> 00:03:44,686
Can you find circle and square?

78
00:03:46,886 --> 00:03:49,211
Circle and square!

79
00:03:49,761 --> 00:03:51,786
Great job!

80
00:03:53,486 --> 00:03:56,211
Can you find triangle and star?

81
00:03:58,411 --> 00:04:00,837
Triangle and star!

82
00:04:01,387 --> 00:04:03,362
You got it!

83
00:04:05,062 --> 00:04:07,612
Can you find heart and oval?

84
00:04:09,812 --> 00:04:12,036
Heart and oval!

85
00:04:12,586 --> 00:04:14,286
Super!

86
00:04:15,986 --> 00:04:19,012
Wow! You remembered everything!

87
00:04:20,862 --> 00:04:23,512
You are a super learner!

88
00:04:25,212 --> 00:04:29,184
Circle, square, triangle, star, heart, rectangle,

89
00:04:29,184 --> 00:04:30,712
oval and diamond!

90
00:04:31,262 --> 00:04:34,062
Great job, little learner!

91
00:04:34,612 --> 00:04:36,563
Share Mimzi with a friend,

92
00:04:36,563 --> 00:04:39,187
and subscribe for more learning fun!

93
00:04:39,737 --> 00:04:40,782
Next time,

94
00:04:40,782 --> 00:04:43,112
let's learn big and small.

95
00:04:43,362 --> 00:04:45,087
Bye bye!
